  "refined bloody axe": {"id": 1373, "atk": 205, "matk": 0, "def": 0, "weight": 0, "slots": 0, "wpnLvl": 4, "armLvl": 0, "minLvl": 0, "desc": "<span style=\"color:blue\">Rental Items</span><br/><br/>A terrifying axe that is said to fill the entire battlefield with blood once it cuts flesh.<br><br/><br/><br/><br/>STR +20 <br/><br/>ASPD +5% <br/><br/>Increases movement speed.<br/><br/>Impossible to refine this item.</br>"},
  "refined bloody roar": {"id": 1273, "atk": 148, "matk": 0, "def": 0, "weight": 0, "slots": 0, "wpnLvl": 4, "armLvl": 0, "minLvl": 0, "desc": "<span style=\"color:blue\">Rental Items</span><br/><br/>This katar, known for being effective against humans, is rumored to give a bestial roar when drenched in blood, hence its name.<br/><br/>Pierces Defense of DemiHuman monster.<br/><br/>Recovery HP +3 each 5 seconds.<br/><br/>Impossible to refine this item."},
