  "travel brochure [amatsu]": {"id": 7530, "atk": 0, "matk": 0, "def": 0, "weight": 0, "slots": 0, "wpnLvl": 0, "armLvl": 0, "minLvl": 0, "desc": "[Amatsu Travel Brochure]<br/><br/><br/><br/>The people of Amatsu carry themselves with honor and tranquility.<br/><br/>While visiting the city, make sure to see:<br/><br/><br/><br/>1. The beautiful <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Water Shrine</span>.<br/><br/>2. The <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Lord of Amatsu</span>, who is much more open than rulers of other lands and will talk to visitors and citizens alike.<br/><br/>3. The <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Legendary Tree</span>, that holds many legends. It is said, that when you propose under its branches your marriage will be blessed.<br/><br/>4. The <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Coy Pond</span>, located in the wonderful gardens, whose careful balance and flow reflect the keeper's state of mind."},
  "travel brochure [ayothaya]": {"id": 7533, "atk": 0, "matk": 0, "def": 0, "weight": 0, "slots": 0, "wpnLvl": 0, "armLvl": 0, "minLvl": 0, "desc": "[Ayothaya Travel Brochure]<br/><br/><br/><br/>Transcend your limitations, and find life's perfect philosophy is Ayothaya's Heritage.<br/><br/>While visiting the city, make sure to see:<br/><br/><br/><br/>1. The <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Reclining Philosopher Statues</span>, that symbolise Ayothaya's great Philosophers that all Ayothayans seek to emulate.<br/><br/>2. The <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Shrine in Ayothaya</span> and meditate upon your life's journey. Keep the balance of your mind and body.<br/><br/>3. The <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Tom Yum Goong Restaurant</span> where the famous and truly delicious soup will refuel your body. Don't leave Ayothaya without sampling the dishes there."},
  "travel brochure [kunlun]": {"id": 7531, "atk": 0, "matk": 0, "def": 0, "weight": 0, "slots": 0, "wpnLvl": 0, "armLvl": 0, "minLvl": 0, "desc": "[Gonryun Travel Brochure]<br/><br/><br/><br/>Gonryun is a land in the clouds. Being so high in the air affords an unprecedented view of the world and gives a different mindset to those who allow themselves to think freely.<br/><br/>While visiting the city, make sure to see:<br/><br/><br/><br/>1. The <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Statue of Gonryun's Greatest Philosopher</span>, that stands proudly in the middle of town, ready to inspire great thoughts from all those that gaze upon him.<br/><br/>2. The <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Overlook of the World</span>. There are particular spots that are exceptionally breathtaking, so please watch your step.<br/><br/>3. The <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">small hill in Gonryun</span> that is said to have been the Great Philosophers favorite meditation spot. See if any grand thoughts take you.<br/><br/>4. The <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Mini-town</span> on ground beneath Gonryun that is a lesson against stagnant and small thinking."},
  "travel brochure [luoyang]": {"id": 7532, "atk": 0, "matk": 0, "def": 0, "weight": 0, "slots": 0, "wpnLvl": 0, "armLvl": 0, "minLvl": 0, "desc": "[Louyang Travel Brochure]<br/><br/><br/><br/>Louyang is a spiritual country, where the warrior spirit and clear thinking are highly prized.<br/><br/>While visiting the city, make sure to see:<br/><br/><br/><br/>1. Such wondrous sites such as the <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Statue of the Man and the Tiger</span>, that may inspire you to do your best.<br/><br/>2. The <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Hospital</span>, where the Louyang healers practice their art. There, your body will be cured by a system of body manipulations and diet.<br/><br/>3. The beautiful <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Palace</span> that is protected by the Great Wall of Louyang. It is truly a sight to behold for every visitor.<br/><br/>4. The <span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Tower</span> where people practice there lungs by shouting from it. Something to relax after a hard day of martial arts and spirit training."},
  "treasure box": {"id": 7444, "atk": 0, "matk": 0, "def": 0, "weight": 10, "slots": 0, "wpnLvl": 0, "armLvl": 0, "minLvl": 0, "desc": "An ancient treasure box filled with old coins, ornaments, and jewelry."},
